# Button sentence case

- Use sentence case for every new or edited button and action-link label: capitalize the first word, proper names, and acronyms only.
- Examples: "Try again", "Back to home", "Explore the shop", "Add to cart".
- Home and shop are generic destinations in action labels, not proper names. Standalone navigation labels remain "Home" and "Shop".
- Reuse shared Button variants for primary and secondary actions, including links styled as buttons.
